    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9535" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">com-partĭor</span></b> ,
		īri, v. dep., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to divide something with one</i>,
				<i>to share</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">MVNERA CVM ALIQVO,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 4040</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intellectum prudentiae sapientia compartietur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Ecclus. 1, 24</span></i>
			.—<i>Pass.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">compartiri altario,</span>”
				<i>to be made partaker of</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Aug.
				2</span></i>
			 Serm. Dom. 54.</div>
